This directory is a legacy mirror of the Perl-core repository agent skills.

The canonical guidance and skill tree now live in the sibling `perl`
checkout: `../../perl/AGENTS.md`, `../../perl/CLAUDE.md`, and
`../../perl/.agents/skills/`. Keep this mirror synchronized when those files are
updated.

This directory contains the mirror skill files under `skills/`; its
`AGENTS.md` and `CLAUDE.md` describe how to use them in this legacy layout.

From the `perl_skillz` checkout, check or update this mirror with:

```sh
./sync-agent-skills --check
./sync-agent-skills --sync
```

In short:

- Edit the canonical files in `../../perl/` first.
- Propagate changes to `skills/` when maintaining this mirror.
- Run validation from the `perl` checkout after skill edits.
